{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121627","id":4106009739,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc70vLyL","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121627","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121627.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121627.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121627","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121627/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121627/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121627/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d95c376e17c91ddcc2785b236bf70e837f2aaa7c","number":121627,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix binary resource loading when the type hint is a script class","user":{"login":"devtejasx","id":180245225,"node_id":"U_kgDOCr5S6Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180245225?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx","html_url":"https://github.com/devtejasx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #90769.\n\n### Root cause\n\n`ResourceFormatLoaderBinary::get_recognized_extensions_for_type()` resolves extensions via `ClassDB::get_extensions_for_type()`. That only walks classes registered in `ClassDB`, but a script global class (`class_name` in GDScript) lives in `ScriptServer`'s global class list instead.\n\nSo when the requested type is a custom resource class, the lookup returns an empty list, `ResourceFormatLoader::recognize_path()` finds no matching extension and returns `false`, and the binary loader is skipped entirely. `ResourceLoader::_load()` then ends up with no loader at all and the load fails with:\n\n```\nERROR: No loader found for resource: res://my_resource.res (expected type: MyResource)\n```\n\n`ResourceFormatLoaderText` is unaffected because it offers `tres` for any type that is not a `PackedScene` or `GDExtension`, without consulting `ClassDB`. That asymmetry is exactly why the type hint worked for `.tres` but not `.res`.\n\n### Fix\n\nWhen `ClassDB` yields no extensions and the type is a script global class, resolve the native class it ultimately extends via `ScriptServer::get_global_class_native_base()` and look up the extensions for that.\n\nThe new branch only runs in the case that was previously broken — when `ClassDB` already knows the type, the extension list is non-empty and behavior is unchanged.\n\n### Testing\n\nAdded a regression test to `tests/core/io/test_resource.cpp`. It registers a script global class through `ScriptServer::add_global_class()`, saves the same resource as both `.tres` and `.res`, and asserts both load when the type hint names that class. It unregisters the class afterwards, and adds no fixture files to the repository.\n\nVerified the test genuinely reproduces the bug. On `master` without the fix, the text assertion passes and the binary one fails:\n\n```\ntests\\core\\io\\test_resource.cpp:593: ERROR: CHECK( loaded_binary.is_valid() ) is NOT correct!\n  values: CHECK( false )\n  logged: A binary resource should load when the type hint is a script global class.\n[doctest] test cases: 1 | 0 passed | 1 failed\n```\n\nWith the fix applied, the full suite passes:\n\n```\n[doctest] test cases:   1411 |   1411 passed | 0 failed | 3 skipped\n[doctest] assertions: 421208 | 421208 passed | 0 failed |\n```\n\nBuilt with GCC 15.2 (MinGW/UCRT64) on Windows, `target=editor tests=yes`. Both changed files are clean under clang-format 22.1.5.\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-07-22T07:13:18Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T10:53:53Z","closed_at":"2026-07-22T10:44:10Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"8b1a89826d6192d5dd067269eef15b1a205b5bd9","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"devtejasx:fix-binary-loader-script-class-type-hint","ref":"fix-binary-loader-script-class-type-hint","repo":{"id":1308504818,"node_id":"R_kgDOTf4y8g","name":"godot","full_name":"devtejasx/godot","owner":{"login":"devtejasx","id":180245225,"node_id":"U_kgDOCr5S6Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180245225?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx","html_url":"https://github.com/devtejasx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devtejasx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https:/